  "sourceTitle": "Milk Chocolate Bar Pie",
  "sourceText": "Milk Chocolate Bar Pie\nBy: Barnaby Dorfman\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n6 Milk Chocolate bars\n1 9 oz. carton Whipped Topping\n1/2 cup chopped pecans\n1 pie crust\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Melt bars over medium heat in double boiler. Remove from heat and add Cool Whip and nuts. Pour in baked pie crust and chill.",
